# Ignore everything in this directory
*

# Except .gitignore and dotenv file
!.gitignore
!.env
!.env.secrets.example

# Secret files consumed via compose `secrets:`. Real values stay ignored
# by the blanket `*` above; only the .example templates are committed.
!secrets/
secrets/*
!secrets/*.example

# Jellyfin's config tree stays entirely ignored. Jellyfin generates it on
# first run and owns it thereafter: config/config/network.xml holds the real
# <CertificatePassword>, and config/data/jellyfin.db holds users, devices,
# and playback history. Nothing here is a template.
!config/
